{%- comment -%}
  The Showcase (generic Albert Collects theme): a continuously moving display of real cards, shared by the kiosk hero
  and the homepage preview. Styles: assets/albert-showcase.css. Script: assets/albert-showcase.js.

  What it shows: cards from today's inventory, gliding slowly along a curved line under drifting light, with a second,
  fainter row behind for depth. It is made to be watched from a distance, with nobody touching it.
  What a touch does (never a game, never a sequence):
  - a swipe sends the cards gliding with momentum, then they ease back to their slow drift;
  - a tap on a card brings it forward with one slow turn and a sweep of foil light, shows its name and price, and
    offers its real listing;
  - a touch on empty space moves the light to the finger.

  Where the cards come from: no new data. On the kiosk the script reads the kiosk's own card grid on the same page
  (products and scanned cards, sold ones left out). On the homepage this snippet is given the event collection's
  products as plain data elements (param: items).
  Without JavaScript, with no inventory, or if the effects fail, the stage is a quiet lit backdrop and the heading,
  text and button beside it still work.

  Params:
  - mode: 'kiosk' or 'home'
  - items: (home) HTML of <i data-acs-item ...> elements, one per card
  - listing_label: text of the button shown when a card is brought forward
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="acs acs--{{ mode }}" data-acs="{{ mode }}">
  <div class="acs-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="acs-aurora acs-aurora--a"></span>
    <span class="acs-aurora acs-aurora--b"></span>
    <span class="acs-pattern"></span>
    <span class="acs-spot" data-acs-spot></span>
    <span class="acs-floor"></span>
  </div>
  {%- if items != blank -%}<div class="acs-data" hidden>{{ items }}</div>{%- endif -%}
  <div class="acs-stage" data-acs-stage>
    <div class="acs-row acs-row--back" data-acs-back aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="acs-row acs-row--front" data-acs-front></div>
    <span class="acs-pulse" data-acs-pulse aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>
  <span class="acs-veil" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="acs-panel" data-acs-panel aria-live="polite">
    <p class="acs-panel-tag" data-acs-tag></p>
    <p class="acs-panel-name" data-acs-name></p>
    <p class="acs-panel-meta" data-acs-meta></p>
    <p class="acs-panel-price" data-acs-price></p>
    <div class="acs-panel-actions">
      <a class="acs-btn acs-btn--gold" data-acs-listing href="#"><span>{{ listing_label | default: 'View This Card' | escape }}</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6.500l5.500 5.500-5.500 5.500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
      <button type="button" class="acs-btn acs-btn--ghost" data-acs-back-to-flow>Back to the showcase</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="acs-hint" data-acs-hint aria-hidden="true"><span class="acs-hint-ring"></span>Touch to Explore</p>
</div>
